# Where the site lives. Not secret. The shop is the front door for the games and sits on the same droplet
# as Bag Brawl, Deadpoint and Heads Up (SFO3). It has no server of its own: Caddy serves the files
# straight off disk, and there is no build step, so a deploy is a copy.
DEPLOY_HOST=root@24.199.123.123
# The names Caddy serves the one page under, space separated; the first is the canonical one. Each needs
# A records at Porkbun for the bare name and www pointing at the droplet; Caddy fetches the certificates
# itself once they resolve. www of each is redirected to its bare name.
PUBLIC_HOSTS="brainrotgame.shop gameslop.now"
PUBLIC_HOST=brainrotgame.shop
